<title>BAHRAIN: Bahrain Islamic Bank profit unchanged in a year.</title>
<headline>Bahrain Islamic Bank profit unchanged in a year.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hijri year ending on May 7, 1997</p>
<p>			  (million Bahraini dinars)</p>
<p> Net profit		1.61    vs    1.61</p>
<p> Operating income	8.68    vs    8.76</p>
<p> Operating expenses    1.48    vs    1.60</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds  14.42    vs   14.05</p>
<p> Total Dividend	  1.15    vs    same</p>
<p>Full Name: Bahrain Islamic Bank B.S.C. -- Bahrain newsroom - 973-524424.</p>
